i><li class=\"theme-doc-sidebar-item-category theme-doc-sidebar-item-category-level-1 menu__list-item menu__list-item--collapsed\"><div class=\"menu__list-item-collapsible\"><a class=\"menu__link menu__link--sublist\" aria-expanded=\"false\" href=\"/docs/category/mini-app-development-guide\">Mini App Development Guide</a><button aria-label=\"Toggle the collapsible sidebar category 'Mini App Development Guide'\" type=\"button\" class=\"clean-btn menu__caret\"></button></div></li></ul></nav></div></div></aside><main class=\"docMainContainer_node_modules-@docusaurus-theme-classic-lib-theme-DocPage-Layout-Main-styles-module\"><div class=\"container padding-top--md padding-bottom--lg\"><div class=\"generatedIndexPage_node_modules-@docusaurus-theme-classic-lib-theme-DocCategoryGeneratedIndexPage-styles-module\"><nav class=\"theme-doc-breadcrumbs breadcrumbsContainer_node_modules-@docusaurus-theme-classic-lib-theme-DocBreadcrumbs-styles-module\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumbs\"><ul class=\"breadcrumbs\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/BreadcrumbList\"><li class=\"breadcrumbs__item\"><a aria-label=\"Home page\" class=\"breadcrumbs__link\" href=\"/docs/\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"breadcrumbHomeIcon_node_modules-@docusaurus-theme-classic-lib-theme-DocBreadcrumbs-Items-Home-styles-module\"><path d=\"M10 19v-5h4v5c0 .55.45 1 1 1h3c.55 0 1-.45 1-1v-7h1.7c.46 0 .68-.57.33-.87L12.67 3.6c-.38-.34-.96-.34-1.34 0l-8.36 7.53c-.34.3-.13.87.33.87H5v7c0 .55.45 1 1 1h3c.55 0 1-.45 1-1z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path></svg></a></li><li itemscope=\"\" itemprop=\"itemListElement\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/ListItem\" class=\"breadcrumbs__item breadcrumbs__item--active\"><span class=\"breadcrumbs__link\" itemprop=\"name\">Mini App Integration</span><meta itemprop=\"position\" content=\"1\"></li></ul></nav><header><h1 class=\"title_node_modules-@docusaurus-theme-classic-lib-theme-DocCategoryGeneratedIndexPage-styles-module\">Mini App Integration</h1><p>5 minutes to learn the most important Mini App Integration concepts.</p></header><article class=\"margin-top--lg\"><section class=\"row list_node_modules-@docusaurus-theme-classic-lib-theme-DocCategoryGeneratedIndexPage-styles-module\"><article class=\"col col--6 margin-bottom--lg\"><a class=\"card padding--lg cardContainer_node_modules-@docusaurus-theme-classic-lib-theme-DocCard-styles-module\" href=\"/docs/MiniApp Integration with Supper APP/Introduction\"><h2 class=\"text--truncate cardTitle_node_modules-@docusaurus-theme-classic-lib-theme-DocCard-styles-module\" title=\"Introduction\">📄️ Introduction</h2><p class=\"text--truncate cardDescription_node_modules-@docusaurus-theme-classic-lib-theme-DocCard-styles-module\" title=\"Mini App Integration\">Mini App Integration</p></a></article><article class=\"col col--6 margin-bottom--lg\"><a class=\"card padding--lg cardContainer_node_modules-@docusaurus-theme-classic-lib-theme-DocCard-styles-module\" href=\"/docs/MiniApp Integration with Supper APP/ApplyFabricToken\"><h2 class=\"text--truncate cardTitle_node_modules-@docusaurus-theme-classic-lib-theme-DocCard-styles-module\" title=\"Step 1: Apply Fabric Token\">📄️ Step 1: Apply Fabric Token</h2><p class=\"text--truncate cardDescription_node_modules-@docusaurus-theme-classic-lib-theme-DocCard-styles-module\" title=\"In order to establish communication with the SuperApp API fabric, you must first get a fabric token. For this purpose, you need to apply for a fabric token using the applyFabricToken service.\">In order to establish communication with the SuperApp API fabric, you must first get a fabric token. For this purpose, you need to apply for a fabric token using the applyFabricToken service.</p></a></article><article class=\"col col--6 margin-bottom--lg\"><a class=\"card padding--lg cardContainer_node_modules-@docusaurus-theme-classic-lib-theme-DocCard-styles-module\" href=\"/docs/MiniApp Integration with Supper APP/AuthToken\"><h2 class=\"text--truncate cardTitle_node_modules-@docusaurus-theme-classic-lib-theme-DocCard-styles-module\" title=\"Step 2: Authentication Token\">📄️ Step 2: Authentication Token</h2><p class=\"text--truncate cardDescription_node_modules-@docusaurus-theme-classic-lib-theme-DocCard-styles-module\" title=\"This is for system's that use auto Login functionality. The request for this need to originate from within the SuperApp as it requires the access_token which is generated from with the SuperApp via function call from the Mini App. For more information check the demo provided.\">This is for system's that use auto Login functionality. The request for this need to originate from within the SuperApp as it requires the access_token which is generated from with the SuperApp via function call from the Mini App. For more information check the demo provided.</p></a></article><article class=\"col col--6 margin-bottom--lg\"><a class=\"card padding--lg cardContainer_node_modules-@docusaurus-theme-classic-lib-theme-DocCard-styles-module\" href=\"/docs/MiniApp Integration with Supper APP/RequestCreateOrder\"><h2 class=\"text--truncate cardTitle_node_modules-@docusaurus-theme-classic-lib-theme-DocCard-styles-module\" title=\"Step 3: Request Create Order\">📄️ Step 3: Request Create Order</h2><p class=\"text--truncate cardDescription_node_modules-@docusaurus-theme-classic-lib-theme-DocCard-styles-module\" title=\"This API is used to create an order for the purchase of an item. It will return a prepay ID, which helps you checkout. To create an order, you must first obtain a token from the applyFabricToken method and set it in the header before you can place an order request.\">This API is used to create an order for the purchase of an item. It will return a prepay ID, which helps you checkout. To create an order, you must first obtain a token from the applyFabricToken method and set it in the header before you can place an order request.</p></a></article><article class=\"col col--6 margin-bottom--lg\"><a class=\"card padding--lg cardContainer_node_modules-@docusaurus-theme-classic-lib-theme-DocCard-styles-module\" href=\"/docs/MiniApp Integration with Supper APP/ CheckOut\"><h2 class=\"text--truncate cardTitle_node_modules-@docusaurus-theme-classic-lib-theme-DocCard-styles-module\" title=\"Step 4: Start Pay Order\">📄️ Step 4: Start Pay Order</h2><p class=\"text--truncate cardDescription_node_modules-@docusaurus-theme-classic-lib-theme-DocCard-styles-module\" title=\"At the step of creating an order, the front-end webpage has already obtained the rawRequest information from the back-end Create Order interface. Next, the front-end webpage only needs to call the Super App's jsfunstart_pay API to initiate the payment process by bringing up the payment terminal and entering the password. Below is a sample of the API call.\">At the step of creating an order, the front-end webpage has already obtained the rawRequest information from the back-end Create Order interface. Next, the front-end webpage only needs to call the Super App's jsfunstart_pay API to initiate the payment process by bringing up the payment terminal and entering the password. Below is a sample of the API call.</p></a></article><article class=\"col col--6 margin-bottom--lg\"><a class=\"card padding--lg cardContainer_node_modules-@docusaurus-theme-classic-lib-theme-DocCard-styles-module\" href=\"/docs/MiniApp Integration with Supper APP/Notify\"><h2 class=\"text--truncate cardTitle_node_modules-@docusaurus-theme-classic-lib-theme-DocCard-styles-module\" title=\"Step 6: Notify\">📄️ Step 6: Notify</h2><p class=\"text--truncate cardDescription_node_modules-@docusaurus-theme-classic-lib-theme-DocCard-styles-module\" title=\"After the completion of the payment on the SuperApp, the payment notification (callback) will be sent to the end point that you passed on the createOrder request notify_url parameter in a post method. This endpoint must be whitelisted and configured on the SuperApp server in order to be sent properly.\">After the completion of the payment on the SuperApp, the payment notification (callback) will be sent to the end point that you passed on the createOrder request notify_url parameter in a post method. This endpoint must be whitelisted and configured on the SuperApp server in order to be sent properly.</p></a></article><article class=\"col col--6 margin-bottom--lg\"><a class=\"card padding--lg cardContainer_node_modules-@docusaurus-theme-classic-lib-theme-DocCard-styles-module\" href=\"/docs/MiniApp Integration with Supper APP/queryOrder\"><h2 class=\"text--truncate cardTitle_node_modules-@docusaurus-theme-classic-lib-theme-DocCard-styles-module\" title=\"Step 5: queryOrder\">📄️ Step 5: queryOrder</h2><p class=\"text--truncate cardDescription_node_modules-@docusaurus-theme-classic-lib-theme-DocCard-styles-module\" title=\"The Query Order interface can be used to query a payment in the event of an unsuccessful payment notification.\">The Query Order interface can be used to query a payment in the event of an unsuccessful payment notification.</p></a></article><article class=\"col col--6 margin-bottom--lg\"><a class=\"card padding--lg cardContainer_node_modules-@docusaurus-theme-classic-lib-theme-DocCard-styles-module\" href=\"/docs/MiniApp Integration with Supper APP/MiniAppGetAccessToken\"><h2 class=\"text--truncate cardTitle_node_modules-@docusaurus-theme-classic-lib-theme-DocCard-styles-module\" title=\"MiniAPP Get Access Token\">📄️ MiniAPP Get Access Token</h2><p class=\"text--truncate cardDescription_node_modules-@docusaurus-theme-classic-lib-theme-DocCard-styles-module\" title=\"The request for this need to originate from within the SuperApp as it requires the access_token which is generated from with the SuperApp via function call from the Mini App. For more information check the demo provided.\">The request for this need to originate from within the SuperApp as it requires the access_token which is generated from with the SuperApp via function call from the Mini App. For more information check the demo provided.</p></a></article><article class=\"col col--6 margin-bottom--lg\"><a class=\"card padding--lg cardContainer_node_modules-@docusaurus-theme-classic-lib-theme-DocCard-styles-module\" href=\"/docs/MiniApp Integration with Supper APP/RefundOrder\"><h2 class=\"text--truncate cardTitle_node_modules-@docusaurus-theme-classic-lib-theme-DocCard-styles-module\" title=\"Step 8: refundOrder\">📄️ Step 8: refundOrder</h2><p class=\"text--truncate cardDescription_node_modules-@docusaurus-theme-classic-lib-theme-DocCard-styles-module\" title=\"The Refund Order interface can be used to process refunds for previously successful payments. This allows merchants to return funds to customers when necessary.\">The Refund Order interface can be used to process refunds for previously successful payments. This allows merchants to return funds to customers when necessary.</p></a></article><article class=\"col col--6 margin-bottom--lg\"><a class=\"card padding--lg cardContainer_node_modules-@docusaurus-theme-classic-lib-theme-DocCard-styles-module\" href=\"/docs/MiniApp Integration with Supper APP/RequestSignatureProcess\"><h2 class=\"text--truncate cardTitle_node_modules-@docusaurus-theme-classic-lib-theme-DocCard-styles-module\" title=\"Additionally: RequestSignatureProcess\">📄️ Additionally: RequestSignatureProcess</h2><p class=\"text--truncate cardDescription_node_modules-@docusaurus-theme-classic-lib-theme-DocCard-styles-module\" title=\"On the above requests, we are using a request signature to ensure the authenticity of the data being sent through a network. For this purpose, we require RSA key pairs to sign and verify a request body. Here is a step-by-step guide on how to do a request body signature when sending a request to the payment server.\">On the above requests, we are using a request signature to ensure the authenticity of the data being sent through a network. For this purpose, we require RSA key pairs to sign and verify a request body. Here is a step-by-step guide on how to do a request body signature when sending a request to the payment server.</p></a></article></section></article><footer class=\"margin-top--lg\"><nav class=\"pagination-nav docusaurus-mt-lg\" aria-label=\"Docs pages\"><a class=\"pagination-nav__link pagination-nav__link--prev\" href=\"/docs/H5 Integration with Supper APP/RequestSignatureProcess\"><div class=\"pagination-nav__sublabel\">Previous</div><div class=\"pagination-nav__label\">Additionally: RequestSignatureProcess</div></a><a class=\"pagination-nav__link pagination-nav__link--next\" href=\"/docs/MiniApp Integration with Supper APP/Introduction\"><div class=\"pagination-nav__sublabel\">Next</div><div class=\"pagination-nav__label\">Introduction</div></a></nav></footer></div></div></main></div></div><footer class=\"footer footer--dark\"><div class=\"container container-fluid\"><div class=\"footer__bottom text--center\"><div class=\"footer__copyright\">Copyright 1894-2026 © Ethio telecom. All rights reserved.</div></div></div></footer></div>\n    \n    \n  \n\n</body></html>",
